- Treat room coverage as a certificate computed from robot-owned sensor/map evidence: visible floor, blind/occluded/unreachable residual, stated threshold, and explanation for residual floor. Do not declare success from frontier exhaustion, an LLM assertion, or a timer. Small rooms may require doorway standpoints because of the camera’s near-floor blind region. `tools/eval/room_coverage.py` caught an injected 97% certificate with actual `true_share: 0.0`. [Task 1][Task 2]
